This is a minimal source copy of the standalone cadcraft-dxf package. Its
src/lib.rs and the two license files are unchanged. Cargo.toml materializes the
upstream workspace version, edition, license, dependency and lint settings so
the package can be used without the CADCraft workspace. The repository field
is added to retain origin. No implementation changes are made.

The source comment credits Autodesk's published DXF Reference. CADCraft and
this application are independent projects and are not affiliated with,
sponsored by or endorsed by Autodesk, Inc. AutoCAD and DWG are trademarks of
Autodesk, Inc.

Only crates/dxf source is included. Other CADCraft crates, DWG/acadrust code,
ArtCraft brand assets, fonts, drawings, screenshots and research artifacts
are not part of this vendored package. The ArtCraft name is used only for
plain-text copyright and upstream attribution.

